  "bodyHash": "49bd91a39af1d939",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-bkNzVBcvlQ?si=aI76FnM_H1tK7v2X\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">Stellaris 在熟悉的 Minecraft 宇宙中引入了广阔而沉浸式的太空探索体验</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。玩家可以发现新的行星</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">、卫星和星系！</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><br></span>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>（仅限 Fabric）、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sky-aesthetics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sky Aesthetics</a> 以及 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potentials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Potentials API</a><br></strong><br></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\"><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bold;border:0px;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">需要帮助？有 Bug 想向我们反馈，或者只是想和友善的玩家交流？加入我们的 Discord 服务器：<span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"> </span><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Xb2nPmN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-decoration:var(--link-decoration);text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">https://discord.gg/Xb2nPmN</span></span></a></span></span></strong></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fstellaris\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1036270/description_c7a2d67b-003b-4568-9712-c97dfc9800a3.webp\" alt=\"需要和朋友一起玩服务器吗？使用优惠码“stellaris”在 bisecthosting.com 购买任何服务器均可享受 75 折优惠！\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></span></strong></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">火箭制作与发射</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">玩家可以使用我们全新的火箭组件系统制作自己的火箭</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">支持对航天器进行逐步升级和自定义</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">行星探索</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">模组添加了多种可供探索的行星和卫星</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，每个天体都有独特的环境和重力等级</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。部分星球拥有外星动植物</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，而其他星球则蕴藏着稀有矿物与宝藏</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/942/526/stellaris-mercury.png\" alt=\"截图\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">先进技术与机械</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">模组引入了多项新技术，例如高级能源系统</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">、用于资源开采与加工的机械</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，以及专为太空生存与探索设计的工具</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/942/535/stellaris-rocket2.png\" alt=\"Stellaris 火箭\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">外星生物与敌对实体</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">太空并非没有危险</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。玩家可能会遇到外星物种</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，其中部分具有敌意，需要采取战略战术才能战胜</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/942/532/stellaris-mars.png\" alt=\"截图\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">多人游戏兼容</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">模组支持多人联机游玩</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，让玩家能够共同踏上太空冒险之旅</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，合作完成建造项目</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，并以团队形式探索宇宙</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">自定义选项</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">：</span></strong> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">玩家可以在模组内调整各项设置，以定制太空冒险的难度与复杂度</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，使其既适合休闲玩家，也适合硬核太空爱好者</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span> <span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">总体而言</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，这款Minecraft太空模组将游戏转变为一块广阔的太空探索前沿</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，提供了无尽的冒险机遇</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">、创造力发挥空间</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">以及探索发现的乐趣</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。无论你是</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">正在建造繁荣的太空殖民地，还是深入银河系的未知深渊</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">，该模组都为所有Minecraft玩家带来了丰富且引人入胜的体验</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"border:0px;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><strong style=\"font-weight:bold;border:0px;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\"><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size:16px\">数据包与插件支持：</span><span style=\"border:0px;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-family:gg sans&amp;#x27;font-size:16px;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:oklab(0.0852327 0.00000386313 0.00000170618 \\2f 0.06)\">你可以使用数据包轻松添加新行星，或使用插件创建新功能，开发者维基可在此查阅 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fst0x0ef.github.io%252fstellaris%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a></span></strong></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>整合包：</strong>&nbsp;欢迎将此模组放入你的整合包中，无需询问！</p>\n<p><strong>需要帮助开始游玩该模组吗？</strong> 别担心！好吧，Jav会帮到你！观看他关于Stellaris的精彩教学视频吧！</p>\n<span><span><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oZwi3zcYi7c?si=BycuDeuhaJk3uHqD\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
